      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "AI Expert on Anthropic’s “Fantasy” Projections, Nvidia",
      "d": "Gary Marcus, NYU Emeritus Professor of Psychology and Neural Science, discusses the recently rumored total addressable market (TAM) figures presented by AI companies like Anthropic, which suggest a market size comparable to the entire U.S. GDP. He expresses skepticism about the realism of such enormous valuations and market opportunities, noting that while AI impacts many areas, not everyone is us",
